        },
        {
          "text": "Mbega dutanguye kwongera kwishimagiza? Canke turinda ivyete vyo kudushimagiza, mwandikiwe canke mwanditse, nk’uko bamwe bandi bagomba? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.1",
