        },
        {
          "text": "Kuko muboneka ko mur’ icete Kristo yatwandikishije, nk’ukw igikorwa cacu kiri; kitandikishijwe wino, ariko candikishijwe Mpwemu w’Imana nzima; kitanditswe ku bisate vy’amabuye, ariko canditswe ku bisate ni vyo mitima y’inyama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.3"
            ]
          }
        }
